WEBVTT

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:10.160
I told you, don't cut it like that!

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.250
But I hate scallions...

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.250
Huh? But they're really good!

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.410
The fish stock is perfect.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:26.870
I'm hungry...

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.910
Yes, I'm starving too.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.330
I'm so happy that we're all together!

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.410
"In the small village of a small country,

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:53.120
Hikari Kagura                  Stage of Fate

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:46.040
there was a traditional summer Star Festival."

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:50.830
"Below a shooting star that falls once a year..."

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:53.160
"Flora and I..."

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.790
"Claire and I..."

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.290
"...had our fateful encounter."

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:12.000
"It's as if we've been together forever!"

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:19.950
"Let's meet here again next year,
on the night of this Star Festival!"

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:22.950
"Starlight."

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:26.410
"Being drawn by the light of the star."

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.830
"It is a story of fate..."

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:38.810
Revue Starlight

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.660
"Who are you?"

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.370
"I don't understand!"

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:01.950
"I can recall that it was something important...
but I don't remember what it was!"

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:04.830
"Maybe we can get it back."

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:11.910
"Tonight, at the Star Festival that happens once
a year, if I can take hold of that star...

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:14.330
your memories may come back as well."

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:21.410
"If you catch a small star,
you've obtained a small bit of happiness."

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:27.790
"If you catch a large star,
you've obtained a large fortune."

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:34.790
"If you catch both of them,
you've caught an eternal wish."

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:42.910
"Grasping the Star means forgiveness for your sins."

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.910
"Grasping the Star is a miracle of the Night!"

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:56.910
"Please take this... the star that you have wished for!"

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.040
"I remembered..."

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:30.330
"Our dream will not come to be."

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:36.700
"She was separated from Claire for the rest of eternity."

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:43.830
"And overhead, the stars continued to sparkle, forever."

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.450
Starlight...

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:53.250
It's the story of a faraway star, set long
in the past and yet far into the future.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:07.160
The tale of a small town in a small village...
Of a summer Star Festival.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:14.750
Building toward eternity, only to fall to ruin
for the cycle to begin again.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:17.500
A stage that never ends...

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:24.830
Taking on the "shine" that this stage requires -
enough for someone else, as well.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:28.500
Such is the atonement for a Stage Girl
who must surely die...

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:34.410
The stage of fate that she has chosen.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.080
I understand.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:51.160
It's ready, guys!

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:54.410
This really warms you up!

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:55.910
My glasses... My glasses!

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.410
You like crab, huh?

00:04:58.120 --> 00:05:00.620
This crab Tendo made is amazing!

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.660
My shrimp are good too, though!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:10.000
Oh, Banana-chan, Hikari-chan doesn't like tofu.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.160
Oh yeah.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:15.910
What?! But it's good tofu, sent all the way from Sagano!

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:18.250
Also, she doesn't like things that are too hot.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.830
So, she's like a picky cat, huh?

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:22.870
I think I get where she's coming from.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.410
So then, Karen
is the dog?

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:28.370
Karen is always chasing after us, huh?

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.620
Arf, arf!

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:33.700
Always having to look after those
two must have been pretty rough, huh?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.620
I have a hard enough time just looking after Kaoruko.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.790
I'm the one who's taking care of you, Futaba.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.700
It was fun... really fun.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.250
It wasn't for long, but...

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:50.000
I really had fun, and that time is precious to me.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:51.950
So...

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:15.750
"In the small village of a small country,
there was a traditional summer Star Festival."

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:20.330
"Below a shooting star that falls once a year..."

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:22.870
"Flora and I..."

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:25.120
"Claire and I..."

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:29.120
"...had our fateful encounter."

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:36.410
I'm sorry I kept you waiting, Hikari-chan.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.910
Jumping in once again, are you?

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.040
I understand.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:50.160
I'm sorry, Hikari-chan.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.950
I didn't understand anything.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:07:00.450
You're all alone in order to not take my shine from me.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:04.160
"Who are you?"

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:06.950
Huh?

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:18.700
"I don't understand. Your voice, your warmth...
the promise I made to you..."

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.750
"I can recall that it was something important..."

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:26.330
"But I don't remember what it was!"

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.700
"Maybe we can get it back!"

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:38.870
"Tonight, at the Star Festival that happens once a year...
if I can take hold of that star...

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:42.040
your memories may come back as well."

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:48.450
"Let's go. Together, we will grasp that star."

00:07:53.450 --> 00:08:01.040
"Tonight, at the Star Festival that happens once a year...
if I can take hold of that star...

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.450
your memories may come back as well."

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.700
Hikari-chan, wait!

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:12.500
"If you catch both of them,
you've caught an eternal wish."

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:20.830
"Grasping the Star means forgiveness for your sins."

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:25.450
"Grasping the Star is a miracle of the Night."

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.000
Hikari-chan, your hand...

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:29.790
Let's stop this.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:38.870
"Please take this... the star that you have wished for."

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.790
Grasping the Star... A Star...

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.790
...of sin?

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:59.620
Hikari-chan!

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:23.000
"Our dream will not come to be."

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:36.500
Hikari-chan... you're on this stage, forever?

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:41.410
You're giving all the shine for everyone, all on your own...

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.700
Is this your stage of fate?

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:54.410
"In the small village of a small country,
there was a traditional summer Star Festival."

00:09:56.540 --> 00:10:00.790
"Below a shooting star that falls once a year..."

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:03.080
Why?

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.830
Why are you alone?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.410
"Flora and I..."

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:12.500
Hey, Hikari-chan, do you remember?

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:15.200
Do you remember what we promised?

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:24.370
Let's go back, Hikari-chan.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:29.910
Our "Starlight" hasn't started yet!

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:34.290
Idiot. Idiot, idiot.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.870
Karen, you idiot!

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:40.080
You're always, always jumping in...

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:41.910
Why...

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:45.000
Why do you come to see me?

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:54.250
I'll start to miss you, right?

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.330
Hikari... chan?

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.040
Your lines stopped...

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:06.160
The performance has ended.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.620
This star tiara has no meaning...

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:21.620
Just like the star that Flora and Claire were striving for.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:29.200
It's a light to invite new sinners to the "stage of fate."

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:33.120
Goodbye...

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.620
...Karen.

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.660
I made a promise...

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:45.330
I... No, we...

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:49.450
We will become stars, together!

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:56.010
I AM                                              REBORN

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.810
No. 99 Trolley Furnace

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:09.750
Sewing Process

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:48.770
Epilogue
Drama STARLIGHT
Revue of the Star's Sin

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:48.790
This is my stage of fate.

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:53.660
A stage where I continue performing, all on my own.

00:12:55.450 --> 00:13:00.410
I tried to capture that star, and I lost my shine.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:26.330
Since I couldn't capture it myself...
this time I tried to steal it.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:31.040
My foolish and wicked stage of fate!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.580
If you are wicked, then...

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.330
every one of us that took part
in the audition are just as guilty!

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:58.580
You don't understand why I'm only observing?

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:00.250
I understand.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:06.250
A stage is composed of both those who perform
and those who are spectators.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:11.450
The performer stars on stage, and as long as the
spectators wish for them to be there, they will remain.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:18.450
Right... You did this to continue watching over the girls.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.450
I do not want to make this performance end partway.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.790
Though I am a spectator who loves the stage...

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:30.040
I am the host of the stage of fate.

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:35.000
The eternal moment of the Stage Girls...

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:38.250
The shine bursting forth...

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:42.790
I want to see that!

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:46.660
Yes, along with you.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.160
I understand.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.250
Here there are no co-stars or stagehands!

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.830
You know you can't have a performance alone!

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:21.830
I didn't want you to experience the torment of loss.

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:27.830
I've already experienced it! So let's go back, Hikari-cha...

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:44.200
I sacrificed my life to this stage and
I will continue to perform forever.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.410
Hikari...chan?

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.450
That is my atonement.

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.160
My fate...

00:15:56.790 --> 00:16:00.370
Our dream will not come to be.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:09.750
What?

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:19.500
Is that Claire?

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:28.330
And the girl confined alone in the tower...

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.500
Hikari-chan?

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:39.420
No. 99 Trolley Furnace

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.310
Please do not touch

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:45.950
Non, non, I say.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:53.200
You were imprisoned this entire time, weren't you?
You shouldered our burdens...

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:55.790
Wait for me, Claire...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.450
I'm going to...

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:00.410
take you back!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:09.620
"Starlight" is a tragedy where we must part...
but there must also be an ending where that isn't true!

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:15.620
She falls from the tower, but...
there must also be a time where Flora rises up!

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:21.500
In order to get to Claire...
Flora climbs the tower once more!

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.750
What... is this?

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:31.500
Has the continuation of the conclusion of
the stage of fate with no end started?

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:32.720
Drama  STARLIGHT

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:36.250
The recreation of the stage of fate!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.250
If you do that...

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:44.870
my stage of fate will be stolen,
and your shine will also be taken!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.160
They can take it!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.200
All I have!

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:53.290
Even if it's taken, it isn't the end!

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:56.160
Even if I lose it, my shine won't disappear!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:18:01.910
Every time I stand on stage, no matter
how many times I burst into flames and am reborn!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.700
Tokyo... Tower...

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:10.040
I am... reborn!

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:13.140
I AM                                              REBORN

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:28.450
The Stage Girl that jumped in...
is she starting a continuation of the ending?

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:35.410
STAGE EQUIPMENT
Promise Tower Bridge

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.750
A chemical reaction from a Stage Girl...

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.000
A most unpredictable stage!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:43.790
This is precisely the stage I wanted to see! I understand!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:47.450
Stage Girls are brought to life by the stage.

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:51.700
To me, the stage is Hikari-chan.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:58.910
If you aren't there, then my performance can't start!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.580
Hikari-chan, you have to be there!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:08.040
So, Hikari-chan...

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:11.500
give me all that you have!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:16.330
I know this.

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:23.200
The first time we saw
the performance together, we shared it...

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.450
...the shine.

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:32.040
Idiot! Idiot, idiot! Idiot Karen!

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.290
Now I want...

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:40.410
...to do Starlight with you...

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:42.950
Hikari-chan!

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:50.290
New Chapter
Drama STARLIGHT

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:10.040
Revue to Capture a Star

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.080
Atop a stage brimming with stardust,

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.830
clad in flowers of love that have
so magnificently bloomed.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.540
From the 99th class, Karen Aijo!

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:25.080
You will do "Starlight"!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:31.370
The shine reborn in my heart overflows
with light and illuminates the stage.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:35.120
From the 99th class, Hikari Kagura.

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:38.370
Let me see you take away my everything.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:10.620
Our stage of fate...

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.120
...started a very long time ago.

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:18.830
The "Star" that Hikari-chan tried to catch...

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:24.330
Karen was the Star I was searching for.

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:29.080
Do you remember that promise we made?

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:33.080
I remember that promise we made.

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:37.540
Position Zero!

00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:43.400
CHANTRY MA'AM

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:49.120
Wait, Claire! I'm on my way now!

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:56.160
If you catch a small star,
you've obtained a small bit of happiness.

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:03.330
If you catch a large star,
you've obtained a large fortune.

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:10.700
If you catch both of them,
you've caught an eternal wish.

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:15.120
How admirably you've found your way to the truth, Flora.

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:19.200
You two have set the goddesses free!

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:23.750
We have been watching over you the entire time.

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:27.950
Now is the time when the star shines...

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:33.410
Grasping the Star means forgiveness for your sins.

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:36.290
Grasping the Star is a miracle of the Night!

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:40.330
Claire...

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:42.540
Flora...

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:51.250
Please take this... the star that you have wished for!

00:22:57.870 --> 00:23:01.580
We found it... It's our star.

00:23:02.660 --> 00:23:06.580
We did find it... It's our fate.

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:14.230
100TH
Seisho Festival

00:23:14.230 --> 00:23:17.230
Seisho Grand Theater

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:22.700
"Starlight"...

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:27.500
We are bound to this by fate.

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:37.330
A new eternal tale, spun by the nine Stage Girls.
